Wall of Caltrops
Steel Wall
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Hill Giant
Memnite
Black Lotus
Mountain
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
